This is the Spain edition of a Lakebase holiday hackathon kit originally created by
Databricks colleagues in the UK, adapted and extended with their agreement.

Third-party data shipped in this repository:
- Road networks in navidad-hack-infra/data/*_osm.csv.gz are derived from OpenStreetMap.
  © OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0:
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
- Land masks in navidad-hack-infra/scripts/es_land.py are derived from Natural Earth
  (public domain): https://www.naturalearthdata.com/

All people, households and journeys are synthetic. Incident scenarios are inspired by
real events; their geometry is illustrative.
